<!-- One part, one complete 6/8 bar: quarter C, quarter D, eighth E, eighth F.
     4 + 4 + 2 + 2 = 12 divisions = 6 eighth notes = a full 6/8 bar, so pickup
     detection does not fire. divisions=4 so an eighth note is a whole number
     of divisions (2). -->
